UPDATE companies SET description='Advanced Sheet Metal was founded in 2006 as a family-owned business in Phoenix, Arizona. The company operates two manufacturing facilities, one in Phoenix and another in Tucson, serving the Arizona market with precision-fabricated sheet metal components for roofing systems.

The company specializes in standing seam metal roofing panels, custom flashing, coping, trim, soffit systems, and a complete line of roofing components. Every item is fabricated to specification with flexible options for profiles, colors, gauges, and finishes. Its capabilities include custom metal fabrication, profile matching, and color variety, all performed in-house at its Phoenix and Tucson plants.

Advanced Sheet Metal serves residential and commercial roofing contractors and builders across Arizona.

