UPDATE companies SET description='Aftermarket Auto Parts Alliance is headquartered in San Antonio, Texas, and has operated since 1978 as a network of independent warehouse distributors, parts stores, and repair shops across North America and beyond. The company operates under the Auto Value and Bumper to Bumper brands, serving as a distribution and marketing program group for the automotive aftermarket.

It provides warranty programs including the Confidence Plus North American Warranty and SafeRoute Roadside Assistance, an online ordering platform called MyPlace4Parts for repair shops, and carries manufacturer lines such as Perfect Stop, Parts Master, Perfect View, MacPherson, Ultra Stop, and Auto Body Master.

Its customers are independent automotive repair shops, warehouse distributors, and retail parts stores that rely on the alliance for parts supply, technical training, marketing support, and business management tools. The network emphasizes local ownership, with each warehouse distributor independently owned and operated.

