UPDATE companies SET description='Alconex Magnet Wire operates from Fort Wayne, Indiana, where it manufactures custom magnet wire and extrusion products for a global market. The company describes itself as American-owned and American-made, though it does not disclose a founding year or identify its founders by name.

The company specializes in continuous extrusion and wire wrapping, producing bare and insulated magnet wire in aluminum, copper, and their alloys. Shapes include round, square, and rectangular profiles, and custom aluminum extrusions are offered to customer specifications. Packaging options range from continuous spools and reel-less coils to straight lengths. Alconex states that no order quantity is too small or too large, fulfilling anything from a single reel to multiple truckloads.

Alconex serves industries that rely on electromagnetic components, including electric vehicles, traction motors, alternators, and electric motors. Its wire products are also used in lifting magnets, welders, and other industrial machinery. The company additionally offers mechanical solutions for non-electrified applications.

Alconex differentiates itself by claiming the quickest made-to-order lead times in the industry, a responsive customer support team, and design flexibility—asserting that if a design can be put on a print, they can likely manufacture it. Its central Fort Wayne location is cited as advantageous for North American shipping, and the company highlights strong, trust-based partnerships with customers and suppliers.', certifications=ARRAY['ISO 9001','RoHS']::text[], profile='{"capabilities": ["Continuous extrusion of aluminum and copper alloys", "Wire wrapping", "Custom shaped extrusions (aluminum)", "Bare and insulated magnet wire production", "Round, square, and rectangular wire profiles", "Packaging: continuous spools, reel-less coils, straight lengths", "Custom magnet wire manufacturing"], "industries": ["Electric vehicles", "Traction motors", "Alternators", "Electric motors", "Lifting magnets", "Welders", "Industrial machinery", "Mechanical applications"], "materials": ["Aluminum", "Copper", "Aluminum alloys", "Copper alloys", "Nomex (insulation)"], "equipment": [], "volume": "From one reel of material to multiple truckloads", "lead_time": "", "tolerances": "", "built_on": ["Quickest made-to-order lead times in the industry", "No minimum or maximum order quantity (one reel to multiple truckloads)", "Specialized in continuous extrusion and wire wrapping", "Design flexibility: if a design can be put on a print, they can likely manufacture it", "Centrally located in Fort Wayne, Indiana for North American shipping"], "facts_used": ["Company name Alconex Magnet Wire -> db", "Headquarters Fort Wayne, Indiana -> db, /", "Manufactures in Fort Wayne, Indiana -> /", "Products: custom magnet wire, aluminum and copper, round/square/rectangular -> /", "Capabilities: extrusion of aluminum and copper alloys, continuous extrusion, wire wrapping -> /", "Industries: electric vehicles, traction motors, alternators, electric motors, lifting magnets, welders -> /", "Certifications: ISO90