UPDATE companies SET description='All American Electric, LLC was founded in 2005 in Greenwood, Delaware. The family-owned electrical service company was established by owners Trevor E., Joel E., and Bonnie E. to serve residents and businesses across the Delmarva Peninsula with licensed electrical work and backup power solutions.

The company provides a range of licensed electrical services including standby generator installation and maintenance for Generac and Kohler units, electrical panel upgrades, EV charger installation, wiring for new construction and pole barns, outlet and lighting installation, whole-house surge protection, and appliance hookups. The team includes master electricians and factory-trained generator technicians. Since inception, the firm has installed over 1,000 generators and operates across 14 counties in Delaware, Maryland, and Virginia.

Customers are primarily residential homeowners and commercial businesses throughout the Delmarva region. Project examples include whole-home standby generator installations in Lewes, DE; residential power installations in Dover, DE; and generator and solar integration work in Felton, DE. The company also handles electrical work for new construction, shops, and outbuildings.

All American Electric emphasizes its family-owned local presence, transparent pricing, and a 10-year warranty on standby generators. The firm positions itself as a Delmarva partner for backup power and electrical service, backed by factory-trained technicians and 24/7 emergency availability.', certifications=ARRAY['Generac Premier Dealer','Kohler Premier Dealer','Licensed in Delaware and Maryland','Factory-trained Generac and Kohler technicians']::text[], profile='{"capabilities": ["Standby generator installation", "Generator maintenance & repair", "Electrical panel upgrades", "EV charger installation", "Wiring for new construction and pole barns", "Wall outlet installation", "Whole-house surge protection", "Ceiling & exhaust fan installation", "Light fixture installation", "Home appliance installation"], "industries": ["Residential", "Commercial", "Construction"], "materials": [], "equipment": [], "volume": "", "lead_time": "1-2 days for residential standby generator installation once permits and equipment are in place", "tolerances": "", "built_on": ["Family-owned since 2005", "Factory-trained on Generac and Kohler equipment", "Honest, transparent pricing with no hidden fees", "10-year warranty on standby generators", "24/7 emergency service availability"], "facts_used": ["Founded 2005 in Greenwood, DE -> /about", "Family-owned since 2005 -> /about", "Owners: Trevor E., Joel E., Bonnie E. -> /about", "Licensed in DE, MD, Delmarva Peninsula -> /", "Generac & Kohler Premier Dealer -> /", "1000+ generators installed -> /", "14 counties served -> /", "Services: generator install, panel upgrades, EV chargers, wiring, outlets, surge protection, fans, lighting, appliances -> /", "Team includes master electrician, factory-trained techs -> /about", "Residential and commercial customers -> /", "Project examples: Lewes, Dover, Felton -> /", "10-year warranty on standby generators -> /about", "24/7 emergency service -> /about", "Transparent pricing -> /about"], "company_type"