, "company_type": "Installer / service company", "makes_products": "no", "type_evidence": "All Energy Solar offers expert solar installation in Massachusetts for homes and businesses.", "founded_year": "2009", "employee_count": "", "cage_code": "", "min_order": "", "export_compliance": [], "languages": [], "social_links": [], "ownership_tags": []}'::jsonb, updated_at=now() WHERE slug='all-energy-solar' AND approved AND profile IS NULL;
UPDATE companies SET description='All Original Foods, Inc. was founded in 1964 in Bessemer, Alabama, by Dewaine Carlson. Carlson partnered with a New York-based company to establish the Original Crispy Pizza Crust Company of Alabama, aiming to bring authentic, high-quality pizza products to the Southern market. The business has since transitioned to second-generation family ownership and management.

The company operates as a specialty and Italian food distributor, sourcing products from around the world. Its offerings are evaluated in an on-site test kitchen where items are tested, compared, and tasted before being added to the catalog. All Original Foods also provides education and hands-on training to its customers and tracks industry trends. Through membership in Bellissimo Foods, a nationwide association of Italian food distributors, the company leverages collective buying power to access a broad selection of ingredients. It describes itself as the largest Italian food distributor in Alabama.

Its focus is on building long-term partnerships through product quality and support services.

