UPDATE companies SET description='All-Type Sheet Metal Fabrication was founded in 2000 in Charlotte, North Carolina. Operating as All Type Sheet Metal Inc., the company has spent over two decades producing HVAC ductwork for projects across the Southeast, building a reputation for on‑time delivery and custom fabrication.

