UPDATE companies SET description='Allcable, a wire and cable distributor, has operated from Denver, Colorado since its founding in 1983.

The company stocks and distributes a range of cable products including fiber optic, voice and data, access control, security, surveillance, lighting, and home theater wiring. Beyond distribution, Allcable provides custom cable services such as cutting, striping, dying, printing, twisting, paralleling, bundling, and respooling.

