UPDATE companies SET description='Amen Packaging Inc. has operated from Denver, Colorado since its founding in 1979. The business began in a modest space beneath a busy highway and has since expanded to a newer central Denver location while remaining a locally rooted enterprise.

The company functions as a wholesale distributor of rigid packaging containers — including Boston rounds, amber glass bottles, woozy bottles, jars, cans, and pails — and provides custom printing and labeling services. It offers packaging design consultation, implementation, and delivery, positioning itself as a turnkey supplier for container solutions.

Amen Packaging serves the paint and coatings, food and co‑packing, chemical, general industrial, cosmetic, wine and spirits, and health and pharmaceutical sectors. Its customer base includes industrial manufacturers, co‑packers, and brand owners requiring regulatory‑compliant containers for hazardous materials, food‑grade products, and export shipments.

The firm emphasizes its 45‑plus years of service to the Rocky Mountain region and a philosophy that industrial packaging should reduce risk rather than add cost. It differentiates itself through custom bottle and labeling development, a $200 minimum purchase threshold for wholesale orders, and an appointment‑only will‑call pickup system. The company also notes its status as a Denver Broncos Small Business Partner.', certifications=ARRAY[]::text[], profile='{"capabilities": ["Packaging design", "Container printing", "Custom labeling", "Wholesale packaging distribution", "Packaging consultation", "Will\u2011call order pickup"], "industries": ["Paint and Coatings", "Food & Co-Packers", "Chemical", "Industrial", "Cosmetic", "Wine and Spirits", "Health and Pharma"], "materials": [], "equipment": [], "volume": "", "lead_time": "", "tolerances": "", "built_on": ["45+ years serving the Rocky Mountain region", "Custom bottle and labeling solutions", "Wholesale distributor with $200 minimum order", "Will\u2011call pickup by appointment only", "Packaging design and consultation services"], "facts_used": ["Founded 1979 -> db", "Headquarters Denver, Colorado -> db", "Wholesale distributor -> homepage", "Minimum purchase $200 USD -> homepage", "45+ years of service to Rocky Mountain region -> homepage", "Industries served: Paint and Coatings, Food & Co-Packers, Chemical, Industrial, Cosmetic, Wine and Spirits, Health and Pharma -> homepage", "Product collections: Boston Rounds, Amber Glass, Woozy Bottles, Jars -> homepage", "Custom bottles and labeling solutions -> homepage", "Will-call order pickup by appointment only -> homepage", "Denver Broncos Small Business Partner -> homepage", "Packaging design, implementation, delivery -> homepage", "Industrial packaging should reduce risk\u2014not add cost -> homepage", "Started from small location under a busy highway -> homepage"], "company_type": "Distributor / reseller", "makes_products": "no", "type_evidence": "As a wholesale distr