UPDATE companies SET description='American Tire and Motorsports operates from a single facility at 689 McLean Avenue in Yonkers, New York. The company''s founding year and ownership structure are not publicly disclosed on its website.

The business functions as a retail and installation center for aftermarket automotive parts and accessories, focusing on pickup trucks, SUVs, Jeeps, and UTVs. Its service offerings include custom fabrication projects and interior/exterior coating applications, notably DINITROL rust proofing. The shop stocks and installs products from brands such as Rampage Products, Buyers Products Company, ZROADZ Off Road Products, RIGID Industries, Westin Automotive, Artec Industries, and Energy Suspension. Product categories span automotive lighting, bumpers and grille guards, cargo management, suspension systems, towing accessories, truck bed covers, wheels and tires, winches, and bedliners.

The company serves individual vehicle owners and enthusiasts seeking upgrades for off-road and on-road use. Its customer base includes drivers of Chevrolet, Dodge, Ford, GMC, Jeep, Land Rover, Ram, and Toyota vehicles who require professional installation of purchased parts.

American Tire and Motorsports positions itself as a one-stop provider where customers can purchase parts and have them installed on-site, summarized by the slogan "BUY A PART? WE CAN INSTALL IT!" The team describes itself as industry enthusiasts who personally use the products they sell.', certifications=ARRAY[]::text[], profile='{"capabilities": ["Fabrication Projects", "Interior/Exterior Coatings", "DINITROL Rust Proofing", "Parts Installation", "Automotive Lighting Installation", "Suspension Installation", "Towing Accessory Installation", "Truck Bed Cover Installation", "Winch Installation", "Bedliner Application", "Running Board and Step Installation", "Bumper and Grille Guard Installation"], "industries": ["Automotive Aftermarket", "Pickup Truck Accessories", "SUV Accessories", "Jeep Accessories", "UTV Accessories", "Off-Road Equipment"], "materials": [], "equipment": [], "volume": "", "lead_time": "", "tolerances": "", "built_on": ["One-stop purchase and professional installation at the same location", "Custom fabrication projects for truck and SUV modifications", "DINITROL rust proofing and interior/exterior coating services", "Product selection curated by staff who use the parts themselves"], "facts_used": ["Location: 689 McLean Avenue, Yonkers, NY 10704 -> /", "Phone:  -> /", "Services: Fabrication Projects, Interior/Exterior Coatings -> db, /", "DINITROL rust proofing offered -> /", "Brands carried: Rampage Products, Buyers Products Company, ZROADZ, RIGID Industries, Westin Automotive, Artec Industries, Energy Suspension -> /, db", "Product categories: automotive lighting, bumpers, cargo management, suspension, towing, truck bed covers, wheels/tires, winches, bedliners -> /", "Vehicle makes served: Chevrolet, Dodge, Ford, GMC, Jeep, Land Rover, Ram, Toyota -> /", "Slogan: BUY A PART? WE CAN INSTALL IT! -> /", "Team described as industry enthusiasts who use products -> db"], "company_type": "Installer / service company", "makes_products": "no", "type_eviden